Value Filldown SLOT (\d+)
Value Required SUBSLOT (\d+)
Value Required PORTNUM (\d+)
Value PCB_VERSION (\S+)
Value FPGA_VERSION (\S+)
Value CPLD_VERSION (\S+)
Value BOOTROM_VERSION (\S+)
Value ADDRESS_MODE (\S+)
Value TYPE (\S+)
Value Required STATE (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*Slot\s+${SLOT}\s*:?[ \t]*$$
  ^\s*SubSNo\s+PortNum\s+PCBVer\s+FPGAVer\s+CPLDVer\s+BootRomVer\s+AddrLM\s+Type\s+State\s*$$
  ^\s*${SUBSLOT}\s+${PORTNUM}\s+${PCB_VERSION}\s+${FPGA_VERSION}\s+${CPLD_VERSION}\s+${BOOTROM_VERSION}\s+${ADDRESS_MODE}\s+${TYPE}\s+${STATE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^.*$$
